#: ../../../reference/interfaces/intel-qat-interface.md:2
msgid "intel-qat interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/intel-qat-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The ` intel-qat` interface provides permissions for [Intel QAT](https://"
"www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/details/processors/xeon/features/"
"quick-assist-technology.html) devices to access `VFIO`, `IOMMU` and "
"`QAT_ADF_CTL` nodes."
msgstr ""

